BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tibetan Yoga (Kum Nye)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260917T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260917T100000
UID:cb10fd06b8654cd69fe4f1d7@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Kum Nye is a Tibetan movement practice\, similar to tai chi or
  yoga. This session explores simple exercises using movement\, breath and 
 awareness to release tension and develop a deeper sense of ease in both bo
 dy and mind. No prior experience needed.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026-kum-n
 ye-thu
END:VEVENT
